            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I think the `nvim__mcursor_cascading()` check is done too early. It should be done after user input is consumed once. Probably inside a `vim.ui.input` callback and while using some cached value. Maybe something similar to [this](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41657#issuecomment-6041331412).",
